== Effects ==
* Spawns a [[familiar]] that drops random [[pill]]s.
** Acid Baby drops a pill every {{dlc|nr}} 3 / {{dlc|r}} 7 cleared [[room]]s. The first drop happens after {{dlc|nr}} 2 / {{dlc|r}} 6 rooms.
* Upon using a pill, all enemies in the room will be [[poison]]ed.
** {{dlc|nr}} The poison lasts for 2 ticks.
*** {{dlc|r}} The poison lasts for 6 ticks. Enemies also take 10 additional damage.
* {{dlc|r}}{{transformation contribution|Conjoined}}

== Notes ==
* {{dlc|r}} [[Familiar]]s that follow behind Isaac have a certain priority in how close their position is to him over other familiars, with Acid Baby having the lowest priority at {{dlc|nr+}} 6th / {{dlc|r+}} 8th and thus being farther from Isaac than familiars of different priorities.

== Synergies ==
* {{dlc|nr}} {{i|BFFS!}}: The familiar drops pills in a repeating pattern of 2, 2 then 3 rooms. No damage increase on the poison effect.
** {{dlc|r}} Acid Baby drops a pill every 6 cleared rooms.
* [[Vurp!]]: If Isaac's last used pill is a Vurp! pill and Isaac finds another Vurp! pill afterward, he can infinitely generate Vurp! pills and repeatedly use them for mass poison damage.

== Interactions ==
* {{T|Second Hand}}: No effect.
* {{i|Starter Deck}}: All pills dropped by Acid Baby will turn into cards.

